descriptionModule.briefSummary:
Primary Objective:

To assess efficacy aflibercept + 5-fluorouracil (5-FU)/levofolinate/irinotecan (FOLFIRI) by objective response rate (ORR).

Secondary Objective:

To assess the following:

* safety profile;
* progression free survival (PFS);
* overall survival (OS);
* pharmacokinetics (PK);
* immunogenicity.
